national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A disk device comprising a plurality of rotatable supporting means on which a supporting part for supporting a part of a disk peripheral part is formed and a support control means which rotates the plurality of supporting means according to how the disk is operated so as to control the supporting state of the supporting part on the disk peripheral part.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un dispositif à disques comprenant une pluralité d'éléments de support rotatifs sur lesquels une partie de support servant à supporter une partie de la zone périphérique d'un disque, est formée. Le dispositif comprend également des éléments de commande de support qui font tourner la pluralité d'éléments de support en fonction du fonctionnement du disque de manière à commander l'état de support de la partie de support sur la zone périphérique du disque.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>